*/

/** \fn IMPORT_C TInt RSemaphore::Open(TInt aArgumentIndex, TOwnerType aType=EOwnerProcess)
Opens a handle to a semaphore using a handle number passed as an environment data item to the child process during the creation of that child process.

Note that this function can only be called successfully once.

RProcess::SetParameter()

\param aArgumentIndex An index that identifies the slot in the process environment data that contains the handle number. This is a value relative to zero, i.e. 0 is the first item/slot. This can range from 0 to 15.

